Host-only (macOS SDK): zlib's zutil.h in both binutils-2.45/zlib and
gcc-13.4.0/zlib treats TARGET_OS_MAC as classic Mac OS and redefines fdopen,
which breaks <_stdio.h>. Same fix as the existing 10.5 toolchain (README.md,
"The toolchain"). Apply to both extracted trees.

--- a/zlib/zutil.h
+++ b/zlib/zutil.h
@@
-#if defined(MACOS) || defined(TARGET_OS_MAC)
+#if defined(MACOS)
